  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Runtime Gizmos draws debug primitives in the Lens: lines, circles, splines, closed polylines and spirals, rendered with the SIK line renderer.
    Each gizmo tracks its target objects every frame, so it follows them when they move.
    Use Previous and Next to step through the five gizmos; the panel describes what each one shows.
