      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "A straight line drawn between two objects (start and end), redrawn every frame so it follows them when they move."
        - "Four points connected into a closed shape, drawn as one continuous line (or as separate segments when Continuous Line is off)."
        - A ring around the center object with a configurable radius and segment count. It is redrawn whenever the center moves or rotates.
        - A smooth Catmull-Rom curve through five control points; the tension controls how tight the curve is. It updates when a control point moves.
        - "A spiral around its center: linear, exponential, logarithmic or helix growth, with configurable radius, loops and axis."
